  "description": "OneDrive provider for FileVault (personal and work/school accounts). Implements IFileProvider over Microsoft Graph with a plain HttpClient: upload sessions for large files, server-side copy and move, recycle bin, thumbnails, search and public links. Ships an OAuth 2.0 authorization code + PKCE helper for desktop apps. NativeAOT-compatible, no Graph SDK or MSAL.",
